===Format===
The teams agreed that the format would be bo3 with a random decider in case of a tie after two rounds.

===Watch the game===
You can watch the game on youtube [https://youtu.be/gVJyTn32aa0?t=14629 HERE] or download the MVD's [https://upload.foppa.dk/files/mirage_italy_MVD.zip HERE]. If you dont have the maps you can DL it from a quakeworld server (foppa, troopers amongst others) or DL the maps [https://upload.foppa.dk/files/mirage_italy_beta1.zip HERE].


